import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 560 | Time Ethics | Ethical Review of Acceleration-Domain Use","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 560 | Time Ethics | Ethical Review of Acceleration-Domain Use","no":560,"module":3,"tags":["Time Ethics","Origin Acceleration Domain","Ethical Review","Admission","Privilege"],"related":["19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries","88-Cross-Plane Ethical Principle","502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle","22-Joint-Contracting Resource-Distribution Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0560_模块3-时间伦理-加速域使用的伦理审查.md","filePath":"en/0560_模块3-时间伦理-加速域使用的伦理审查.md"}'),o={name:"en/0560_模块3-时间伦理-加速域使用的伦理审查.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,d,h){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-560-time-ethics-ethical-review-of-acceleration-domain-use" tabindex="-1">Entry 560 | Time Ethics | Ethical Review of Acceleration-Domain Use <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-560-time-ethics-ethical-review-of-acceleration-domain-use" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 560 | Time Ethics | Ethical Review of Acceleration-Domain Use&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 19, 88, 502, 22</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-who-qualifies-to-be-fast-matters-more-than-speed-itself" tabindex="-1">Introduction: who qualifies to be fast matters more than speed itself <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-who-qualifies-to-be-fast-matters-more-than-speed-itself" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: who qualifies to be fast matters more than speed itself&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain is the dual-track time domain&#39;s most tempting, most easily unfair resource. It is essentially &quot;free time dividend&quot; — enter a hundredfold faster, exit with a full set of abilities. If admission and use lack strict ethical review, it inevitably degenerates fast into a new privilege tool: the strong cut in by background, the rich buy it by wealth, ordinary people shut out. That would be a rerun of Tang-Luo-style monopoly in the time dimension. This entry covers how ethical review of acceleration-domain use holds the fair line.</p><p>Six top-level axioms run through the review: anti-predation axiom forbids turning the acceleration domain into predatory privilege; republican axiom of Myriad Races is the review&#39;s soul — acceleration dividends accessible to all; collective ascension axiom requires acceleration output return to Myriad Ranks; causal self-discipline axiom requires use leave traces throughout; law-first axiom requires review standards written fixed first by law. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-three-types-of-abuse-the-review-guards-against" tabindex="-1">I. Three Types of Abuse the Review Guards Against <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-types-of-abuse-the-review-guards-against" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Types of Abuse the Review Guards Against&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The acceleration-domain abuse ethical review guards against归纳为 three types:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Abuse Type</th><th>Manifestation</th><th>Essence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Privilege Abuse</td><td>The strong cut in by background, over-gear use</td><td>Time monopoly</td></tr><tr><td>Diversion Abuse</td><td>Fast-track output privately swallowed by individuals, not returned</td><td>Achievement predation</td></tr><tr><td>Addiction Abuse</td><td>Individual unrestrained fast track, experience drained</td><td>Self-harm waste</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Three abuses correspond respectively to the three ethical axes: fairness, autonomy, causality. The review checks them one by one.</p><h2 id="ii-four-questions-of-admission-review" tabindex="-1">II. Four Questions of Admission Review <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-four-questions-of-admission-review" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Four Questions of Admission Review&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Any acceleration-domain use application, ethical review must answer four questions:</p><ol><li><strong>Voluntary?</strong>: Does the applicant enter voluntarily, or arranged, coerced? (autonomy axis)</li><li><strong>Fair?</strong>: Does queuing follow public rules, any privilege cut-in? (fairness axis)</li><li><strong>Purpose?</strong>: Will fast-track output be used for co-building and return, not hoarded? (collective ascension)</li><li><strong>Can Bear?</strong>: Can the applicant&#39;s consciousness, physiological state bear the gear, will it &quot;enter fast, exit empty&quot;? (autonomy axis)</li></ol><p>Four questions all passed, may enter track; any doubtful, downgrade or reject.</p><h2 id="iii-dynamic-review-during-use" tabindex="-1">III. Dynamic Review During Use <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-dynamic-review-during-use" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Dynamic Review During Use&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Review is not limited to admission; throughout use dynamically:</p><ul><li>Alaya Network real-time monitors experience-preservation, warns as approaching individual tolerance ceiling;</li><li>Monitors output flow, once private diversion found, suspend its next admission;</li><li>Monitors queuing fairness, privilege signal once appears immediately correct and publicize.</li></ul><p>Dynamic review upgrades &quot;one-time admission gate&quot; to &quot;throughout continuous supervision,&quot; preventing people in the fast track from &quot;closing the door and doing tricks.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-exit-review-and-output-return" tabindex="-1">IV. Exit Review and Output Return <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-exit-review-and-output-return" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Exit Review and Output Return&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Exit is review&#39;s last gate:</p><ul><li>Experience-preservation detection, confirm the individual &quot;finished fast but not hollowed&quot;;</li><li>Output registration, per joint-contracting mechanism confirm will return to Alaya Network, not hoard;</li><li>One use&#39;s complete record filed, as basis for its future admission priority and civilizational weight.</li></ul><p>Exit review ensures <strong>acceleration domain used once, Myriad Ranks benefit once</strong> — fast-gained abilities ultimately return to Myriad Ranks&#39; hands.</p><h2 id="v-how-review-links-with-civilizational-weight" tabindex="-1">V. How Review Links With Civilizational Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-how-review-links-with-civilizational-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. How Review Links With Civilizational Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>To keep review from being formalistic, admission qualification links directly with the individual&#39;s civilizational weight, historical compliance record: no-violation records enjoy higher priority and longer duration; diversion, cut-in records, per severity downgrade, gear-limited until admission suspended. This linkage is not to create &quot;score anxiety,&quot; but to bind &quot;observing rules&quot; with &quot;taking dividends&quot; — those who can hold ethics deserve to be faster.</p><h2 id="vi-what-an-ordinary-admission-application-looks-like" tabindex="-1">VI. What an Ordinary Admission Application Looks Like <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-what-an-ordinary-admission-application-looks-like" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. What an Ordinary Admission Application Looks Like&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ethical review&#39;s warmth ultimately shows in the process&#39;s friendliness to ordinary people. An ordinary admission application has neither grim thresholds nor tedious obstruction: the system first asks what he wants to learn on the fast track, how long, whether willing to return output; after confirming he understands &quot;finished fast must come back slow,&quot; schedule him a fair spot. Review&#39;s original intent is not shutting ordinary people out, but shutting ill-intentioned people out. When a being who has never cultivated can smoothly fill out this application, the acceleration domain has truly opened to Myriad Ranks.</p><h2 id="vii-the-review-system-s-ultimate-purpose" tabindex="-1">VII. The Review System&#39;s Ultimate Purpose <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-the-review-system-s-ultimate-purpose" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. The Review System&#39;s Ultimate Purpose&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ethical review takes so many detours, ultimately answers a plain question: on what basis do we dare hand a hundredfold-acceleration opportunity to a being without fearing he will misuse it? The answer lies not in how strict review is, but in its layer-by-layer gates making every entrant truly understand this opportunity&#39;s weight. Review does not block people outside, but helps every entrant think clearly why he is fast. When he walks into the acceleration domain with this clarity, review&#39;s purpose is truly achieved.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: review blocks addiction abuse, diversion abuse&#39;s hidden waste pre-event, putting acceleration resources to true co-building</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: review&#39;s core is precisely preventing the acceleration domain from degenerating into predatory privilege</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo who can be fast depends entirely on the protagonist&#39;s bounty; Heng Yuan Zhou uses four-questions + throughout review, handing &quot;who qualifies to be fast&quot; to rules</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: review standards equal for all beings, no distinction by origin, wealth, combat power</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: four-questions standard, dynamic-review metrics, exit-return process all public, under Myriad-Rank supervision</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ethical review of acceleration-domain use guards a plain belief: <strong>time dividend is civilization&#39;s public resource, not the strong&#39;s private shelf.</strong> Whether one can be fast should not be decided by whose background is deeper, fists harder; by who is voluntary, who is fair, who returns output. When an ordinary being can enter the hundredfold acceleration domain by rules, by contribution, and a world-conquering strong one must queue, must return output, Tang-Luo-style time monopoly is truly overturned.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./19-修炼伦理与边界.html">19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries</a> · <a href="./88-跨位面伦理准则.html">88-Cross-Plane Ethical Principle</a> · <a href="./502_模块3-本源加速域-时间流速调控原理.html">502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle</a> · <a href="./22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">22-Joint-Contracting Resource-Distribution Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
